  "event_seq": 107,
  "root_problem": "Billing dispute tickets doubled Aug-Sep 2026 (E-07) because, per the only surviving supported hypothesis (H-RULE-CHANGE), a change to billing import validation rules around August causes the billing system to compute or accept bills incorrectly on accounts with actual (non-estimated) meter reads, generating genuine billing errors that drive disputes. This is evidenced by disputed bills being dominated by ACTUAL-read bills (1785 of 3025, E-02), a pattern that estimate-substitution mechanisms (AMI vendor gaps, field manual-read gaps, staffing shortfall) cannot explain since they act only through estimate substitution, and it is not a response-speed problem since ticket response times are within the 3.0-day SLA (E-04)."
 },
